{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12679","headline":"雪中怀孟武昌 · 元结","name":"雪中怀孟武昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬来三度雪，农者欢岁稔。\n我麦根已濡，各得在仓廪。\n天寒未能起，孺子惊人寝。\n云有山客来，篮中见冬簟。\n烧柴爲温酒，煮鳜爲作渖。\n客亦爱桮尊，思君共桮饮。\n所嗟山路闲，时节寒又甚。\n不能苦相邀，兴尽还就枕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}